<title>USA: Pinnacle Financial Services Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Pinnacle Financial Services Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH, Mich. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended	  Year To Date</p>
<p>			1996	     1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net Income	   $1,261	 $1,568     $6,285     $4,575</p>
<p> Net Income</p>
<p>  Per Share		.21	    .41	 1.07	 1.20</p>
<p>NOTES - Results include $1.4 million or $0.25/shr charge for Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Pinnacle Financial Services Inc.</p>
<p>Assets - $1.0 billion vs $448.5 million</p>
<p>Deposits - $744.8 million vs $380 million</p>
<p>Loans - $588.2 million vs $309.8 million.</p>
